Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:10.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}審視腦內想像後回歸自我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.01,0:20:16.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}正解的逼迫是對我張開血盆大口的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.34,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:22.02,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:24.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:27.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}亮出利爪的那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:32.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}又想要用它去守護誰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:34.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}武器既可傷害也能保護
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:37.97,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}人生不正如這般的雙向交流嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:43.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}就算約定似隱似現 無人再能知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:47.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}也要一心遵守 度過烈火焦灼夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}無知狂笑著引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:53.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}任昔日萬象掌舵方向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:56.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}情緒染上呼出的濕氣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:59.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我無意在一無所知中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}讓它們被你掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:05.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}審視腦內想像後回歸自我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:12.46,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}正解的逼迫是渴望將我吞食殆盡的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:16.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}別再繼續阻擋我的道路了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:24.43,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我絕不會被你所描繪出的理想扼殺
